The '''Architect's First Draft''' is an {{Epic}} [[Dungeon Item]] that can be used to reset a failed [[Catacombs Puzzle Rooms|Dungeon Puzzle]] in the room the player is in. It is consumed on use.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Architect's First Draft''' can be obtained from secret chests on any [[Catacombs]] floor.

